{"schemaVersion":1,"articles":[{"id":"monsters.monster.angulotl.statblock.angulotl-needler","title":"Ангулотл-иглоносец","chapter":"23. Бестиарий","group":"Ангулотлы","path":"Monsters/monster/angulotl/statblock/angulotl-needler.md","originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.angulotl.statblock/angulotl-needler","originalName":"Angulotl Needler","originalDescription":"|    Angulotl, Humanoid    |              -              |      Level 1      |    Horde Artillery    |         EV 3         |\n|:------------------------:|:---------------------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|      **1S**<br>Size      |       **5**<br>Speed        | **10**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **2**<br>Free Strike |\n| **Poison 2**<br>Immunity | **Climb, swim**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|     **+0**<br>Might      |      **+2**<br>Agility      | **+1**<br>Reason  |  **0**<br>Intuition   |  **-1**<br>Presence  |\n\n> 🏹 **Blowgun (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Ranged, Strike, Weapon** |      **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |----------------------------|---------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ranged 15**           |  **🎯 One creature** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 4 poison damage\n> - **12-16:** 6 poison damage\n> - **17+:** 7 poison damage\n>\n> **2 [Malice](scc.v1:mcdm.monsters.v1/rule.monster/malice):** A target who has M < 2 is [weakened](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/weakened) (save ends). A target [weakened](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/weakened) this way takes 2 poison damage at the start of each of their turns.\n\n> ⭐️ **Toxiferous**\n>\n> Whenever an adjacent enemy [grabs](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/feature.common.maneuvers/grab) the needler or uses a melee ability against them, that enemy takes 2 poison damage.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/angulotl/statblock/angulotl-needler.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"angulotl","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"3","size":"1S","keywords":["Ангулотл","Гуманоид"],"role":"Артиллерист","organization":"Орда"},"blocks":[{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.angulotl.statblock.angulotl-needler"},{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.angulotl.angulotl-malice"}],"related":[{"id":"monsters.monster.angulotl.angulotl-malice","title":"Раздор ангулотлов"},{"id":"monsters.monster.group.angulotl","title":"Ангулотлы"},{"id":"monsters.rule.monster.malice","title":"Раздор"}],"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"}}],"entities":[{"id":"monster.angulotl.statblock.angulotl-needler","kind":"monster","name":"Ангулотл-иглоносец","markdown":"| Ангулотл, Гуманоид | - | Уровень 1 | Орда-артиллерист | Боевая ценность 3 |\n|:------------------:|:-:|:---------:|:---------------:|:-----:|\n| **1S**<br>Размер | **5**<br>Скорость | **10**<br>Выносливость | **0**<br>Устойчивость | **2**<br>Свободный удар |\n| **Яд 2**<br>Иммунитет | **Лазание, плавание**<br>Движение | - | **-**<br>С капитаном | **-**<br>Уязвимость |\n| **+0**<br>Мощь | **+2**<br>Ловкость | **+1**<br>Разум | **0**<br>Интуиция | **-1**<br>Присутствие |\n\n> 🏹 **Духовая трубка (знаковая способность)**\n>\n> | **Дальний бой, Удар, Оружие** | **[Основное действие](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |------------------------------|-------------------------------------:|\n> | **Дальний бой 15**            | **Одно существо** |\n>\n> **Бросок силы + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 4 урона ядом\n> - **12-16:** 6 урона ядом\n> - **17+:** 7 урона ядом\n>\n> **2 [Раздора](#/codex/monsters.rule.monster.malice):** Цель с **М < 2** [ослаблена](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.weakened) (до прох.). Цель, [ослабленная](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.weakened) таким образом, получает 2 урона ядом в начале каждого своего хода.\n\n> ⭐️ **Ядовитая кожа**\n>\n> Когда смежный враг [схватывает](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.grab-maneuver) иглоносца или использует против него способность ближнего боя, этот враг получает 2 урона ядом.\n","source":{"articleId":"monsters.monster.angulotl.statblock.angulotl-needler","path":"Monsters/monster/angulotl/statblock/angulotl-needler.md"},"originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.angulotl.statblock/angulotl-needler","originalName":"Angulotl Needler","originalDescription":"|    Angulotl, Humanoid    |              -              |      Level 1      |    Horde Artillery    |         EV 3         |\n|:------------------------:|:---------------------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|      **1S**<br>Size      |       **5**<br>Speed        | **10**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **2**<br>Free Strike |\n| **Poison 2**<br>Immunity | **Climb, swim**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|     **+0**<br>Might      |      **+2**<br>Agility      | **+1**<br>Reason  |  **0**<br>Intuition   |  **-1**<br>Presence  |\n\n> 🏹 **Blowgun (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Ranged, Strike, Weapon** |      **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |----------------------------|---------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ranged 15**           |  **🎯 One creature** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 4 poison damage\n> - **12-16:** 6 poison damage\n> - **17+:** 7 poison damage\n>\n> **2 [Malice](scc.v1:mcdm.monsters.v1/rule.monster/malice):** A target who has M < 2 is [weakened](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/weakened) (save ends). A target [weakened](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/weakened) this way takes 2 poison damage at the start of each of their turns.\n\n> ⭐️ **Toxiferous**\n>\n> Whenever an adjacent enemy [grabs](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/feature.common.maneuvers/grab) the needler or uses a melee ability against them, that enemy takes 2 poison damage.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/angulotl/statblock/angulotl-needler.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"angu